        sw_mtaa: "URGENT: anza supplemental oxygen, fika kituoni chenye oxygen na IV antibiotics ndani ya saa, tibu underlying cause. Usicheleweshe kwa transport arrangements \u2014 start oxygen sasa kama inapatikana."
