      en: "Adjectives (vivumishi) describe a noun\u2019s quality (e.g. -zuri = good, -kubwa = big). They agree with the noun\u2019s class via a prefix: mtu mzuri, kitu kizuri, vitu vizuri. The root is one (-zuri); the prefix changes with the class."
